{"id":"889c50b798f3f5c7","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-game2-point-open-game.md","title":"ZFC Game2 Point Open Game","display":"df-zfc-game2-point-open-game — ZFC Game2 Point Open Game","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-game2-point-open-game","aliases":["58-df-zfc-game2-point-open-game"],"display":"df-zfc-game2-point-open-game — ZFC Game2 Point Open Game","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-game2-point-open-game"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-game2-point-open-game</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-game2-point-open-game — ZFC Game2 Point Open Game"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,X,\\tau,P,W\\in V\">\\(G,X,\\tau,P,W\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (topological-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (typed set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame2PointOpenGame}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame2PointOpenGame}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}point\\text{-}open\\text{-}game}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame2PointOpenGame}_S(G,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\n\\exists P\\in V\\;\\exists W\\in V\\;\\Bigl(G=\\langle P,W\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land P=\\left\\{s\\in V:\\operatorname{Function}(s,\\omega,X\\times\\tau)\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists x\\in X\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau\\;\n\\bigl(s(n)=\\langle x,U\\rangle\\land x\\in U\\bigr)\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land W=\\left\\{s\\in P:X\\subseteq\\bigcup\n\\left\\{U\\in\\tau:\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists x\\in X\\;\ns(n)=\\langle x,U\\rangle\\right\\}\\right\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}point\\text{-}open\\text{-}game}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame2PointOpenGame}_S(G,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\n\\exists P\\in V\\;\\exists W\\in V\\;\\Bigl(G=\\langle P,W\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land P=\\left\\{s\\in V:\\operatorname{Function}(s,\\omega,X\\times\\tau)\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists x\\in X\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau\\;\n\\bigl(s(n)=\\langle x,U\\rangle\\land x\\in U\\bigr)\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land W=\\left\\{s\\in P:X\\subseteq\\bigcup\n\\left\\{U\\in\\tau:\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists x\\in X\\;\ns(n)=\\langle x,U\\rangle\\right\\}\\right\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>At inning <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>, the point player chooses <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_n\">\\(x_n\\)</span> and the open player answers with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_n\\ni x_n\">\\(U_n\\ni x_n\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\">\\(W\\)</span> records the plays in which the chosen open sets cover <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (topological-space predicate, see [[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (typed set-function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G,X,\\tau,P,W\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGame2PointOpenGame}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}point\\text{-}open\\text{-}game}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame2PointOpenGame}_S(G,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\n\\exists P\\in V\\;\\exists W\\in V\\;\\Bigl(G=\\langle P,W\\rangle\\\\\n&{}\\land P=\\left\\{s\\in V:\\operatorname{Function}(s,\\omega,X\\times\\tau)\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists x\\in X\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau\\;\n\\bigl(s(n)=\\langle x,U\\rangle\\land x\\in U\\bigr)\\right\\}\\\\\n&{}\\land W=\\left\\{s\\in P:X\\subseteq\\bigcup\n\\left\\{U\\in\\tau:\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists x\\in X\\;\ns(n)=\\langle x,U\\rangle\\right\\}\\right\\}\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"x_n","display":false},{"tex":"U_n\\ni x_n","display":false},{"tex":"W","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":1553,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2169","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-game2-point-open-game.md|58-df-zfc-game2-point-open-game]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","815e63e5071e7b58","36d7463d215be751"]}